flowchart TD
  RA[Restaurant Admin] -->|Edit internal profile| RP[RestaurantProfile]
  RA -->|Request public name/image change| LCR[ListingChangeRequest: pending]
  LCR --> PA[Platform Admin Approval Inbox]
  PA -->|Reject| RJ[status = rejected]
  PA -->|Approve| TX[MongoDB transaction]
  TX --> R[Restaurant name OR coverImageUrl updated]
  TX --> AP[status = approved + reviewed/applied timestamps]
  R --> PUB[Homepage / Restaurants tab / public Restaurant API]
